    {
     "body": {
      "html": "<div style=\"background: linear-gradient(rgba(201,219,226,.85), rgba(201,219,226,.85)), url('https://4087538.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/4087538/private-label/DV_PL_HeroBackground_2.jpg') center/cover; padding: 90px 20px; text-align: center;\">\n<div style=\"max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto;\">\n<p style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 13px; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: 2px; margin: 0 0 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">FREE DOWNLOAD</span></p>\n<h1 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 48px; font-weight: bold; line-height: 1.15; margin: 0 0 22px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 40px;\">Private Label Client Onboarding Guide.</span><span style=\"font-size: 40px;\"></span></h1>\n<p style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0 0 34px;\">What to expect during your first 90 days as a private label client. Week-by-week timeline, key decisions you will make, design milestones, and how to set yourself up for a smooth launch.</p>\n<a href=\"#get-started\" style=\"display: inline-block; background: #6BA644; color: white; padding: 16px 38px; text-decoration: none; font-size: 15px; font-weight: bold; border-radius: 4px; letter-spacing: .5px;\">Download the Free Guide</a></div>\n</div>"
     },
     "child_css": {},
     "css": {},
     "id": 216207762518,
     "order": 0,
     "styles": {},
     "type": "rich_text"
    },
    {
     "body": {
      "html": "<div style=\"max-width: 850px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 80px 20px 50px;\">\n  <h2 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 32px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.25; margin: 0 0 26px;\">The clearest, most realistic picture of how your first 90 days will go.</h2>\n  <p style=\"color: #333; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0 0 18px;\">Most private label manufacturers under-explain what onboarding actually looks like. The result is misaligned expectations, surprise delays, and projects that drift past their planned launch window.</p><p style=\"color: #333; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0 0 18px;\">This guide walks through the actual cadence of conversations, decisions, deliverables, and approvals you will experience. You will know what to expect every step of the way.</p>\n</div>"
     },
     "child_css": {},
     "css": {},
     "id": 216207762519,
     "order": 1,
     "styles": {},
     "type": "rich_text"
    },
    {
     "body": {
      "html": "<div style=\"background: #f7f7f6; padding: 80px 20px;\">\n<div style=\"max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto;\">\n<h2 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 32px; font-weight: bold; text-align: center; margin: 0 0 16px;\">Your first 90 days with us.</h2>\n<p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 18px; text-align: center; max-width: 760px; margin: 0 auto 60px;\">Each phase has clear deliverables, decision points, and what we need from you to keep things moving.</p>\n<div style=\"position: relative;\">\n<div style=\"position: absolute; top: 36px; left: 8%; right: 8%; height: 2px; background: #c9dbe2; z-index: 1;\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(170px, 1fr)); gap: 30px; position: relative; z-index: 2;\">\n<div style=\"text-align: center; position: relative;\">\n<div style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 72px; height: 72px; background: white; border: 3px solid #6BA644; border-radius: 50%; margin: 0 0 18px; position: relative; z-index: 2;\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#012638\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"width: 32px; height: 32px;\"><path d=\"M4.26 10.15a23.93 23.93 0 0 1 14.66-.36c.41.12.69.5.69.93v6.91a2.62 2.62 0 0 1-1.55 2.39 23.94 23.94 0 0 0-12.94 0 2.62 2.62 0 0 1-1.55-2.39v-6.92c0-.42.27-.8.69-.93Z\">&nbsp;</path><path d=\"M4.26 10.15A23.93 23.93 0 0 1 12 9c1.05 0 2.08.1 3.07.31M4.26 10.15c-.85.46-1.7.98-2.51 1.55a25 25 0 0 0 10.25 5.32\"></path><path d=\"M18.75 11.25v-2.4l3-1.62-7.5-4.23-7.5 4.23 3 1.62v2.4\"></path></svg></div>\n<div style=\"background: #6BA644; color: white; font-size: 11px; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: 1.5px; display: inline-block; padding: 4px 12px; border-radius: 100px; margin: 0 0 12px;\">STEP 01</div>\n<p style=\"color: #6ba644; font-size: 11px; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: 1.5px; margin: 0 0 6px;\">WEEK 1</p>\n<h3 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 18px; font-weight: bold; margin: 0 0 10px; line-height: 1.3;\">Discovery</h3>\n<p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.55; margin: 0;\">Initial call. Audience, brand vision, product mix discussion. Full catalog access.</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center; position: relative;\">\n<div style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 72px; height: 72px; background: white; border: 3px solid #6BA644; border-radius: 50%; margin: 0 0 18px; position: relative; z-index: 2;\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#012638\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"width: 32px; height: 32px;\"><path d=\"M9.81 4.94 9 2.25l-.81 2.69a4.5 4.5 0 0 1-3 3L2.5 8.75l2.69.81a4.5 4.5 0 0 1 3 3l.81 2.69.81-2.69a4.5 4.5 0 0 1 3-3l2.69-.81-2.69-.81a4.5 4.5 0 0 1-3-3ZM18 7.5l-.51 1.71a3 3 0 0 1-2.03 2.03L13.75 11.75l1.71.51a3 3 0 0 1 2.03 2.03L18 16l.51-1.71a3 3 0 0 1 2.03-2.03L22.25 11.75l-1.71-.51a3 3 0 0 1-2.03-2.03L18 7.5ZM16.5 18.75 16.04 20l-.46 1.25-.46-1.25-.46-1.25.46-1.25.46 1.25Z\">&nbsp;</path></svg></div>\n<div style=\"background: #6BA644; color: white; font-size: 11px; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: 1.5px; display: inline-block; padding: 4px 12px; border-radius: 100px; margin: 0 0 12px;\">STEP 02</div>\n<p style=\"color: #6ba644; font-size: 11px; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: 1.5px; margin: 0 0 6px;\">WEEK 2-3</p>\n<h3 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 18px; font-weight: bold; margin: 0 0 10px; line-height: 1.3;\">Product Selection</h3>\n<p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.55; margin: 0;\">Finalize SKUs. Brand assets shared with design team.</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center; position: relative;\">\n<div style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 72px; height: 72px; background: white; border: 3px solid #6BA644; border-radius: 50%; margin: 0 0 18px; position: relative; z-index: 2;\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#012638\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"width: 32px; height: 32px;\"><path d=\"M19.5 14.25v-2.63c0-3.07-2.13-5.78-5.13-6.4-.62-.13-1.24-.25-1.87-.34V3.75A.75.75 0 0 0 11.75 3h-1.5a.75.75 0 0 0-.75.75v1.13c-.63.09-1.25.2-1.87.34-3 .62-5.13 3.33-5.13 6.4V20.25M16.5 18.75h-9a3 3 0 0 1-3-3v-3.75c0-3 1.92-5.62 4.75-6.45M9.75 9h4.5\">&nbsp;</path><path d=\"M3.75 21h16.5M9 12h6m-6 3h6\"></path></svg></div>\n<div style=\"background: #6BA644; color: white; font-size: 11px; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: 1.5px; display: inline-block; padding: 4px 12px; border-radius: 100px; margin: 0 0 12px;\">STEP 03</div>\n<p style=\"color: #6ba644; font-size: 11px; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: 1.5px; margin: 0 0 6px;\">WEEK 4-5</p>\n<h3 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 18px; font-weight: bold; margin: 0 0 10px; line-height: 1.3;\">Label Design</h3>\n<p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.55; margin: 0;\">Label iteration cycles. Final approval gates production.</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center; position: relative;\">\n<div style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 72px; height: 72px; background: white; border: 3px solid #6BA644; border-radius: 50%; margin: 0 0 18px; position: relative; z-index: 2;\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#012638\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"width: 32px; height: 32px;\"><path d=\"M21 7.5 12 12m0 0L3 7.5M12 12v9.75m0-9.75 9-4.5M3 7.5l9 4.5M3 7.5v9l9 4.5m9-13.5v9L12 21.75\">&nbsp;</path></svg></div>\n<div style=\"background: #6BA644; color: white; font-size: 11px; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: 1.5px; display: inline-block; padding: 4px 12px; border-radius: 100px; margin: 0 0 12px;\">STEP 04</div>\n<p style=\"color: #6ba644; font-size: 11px; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: 1.5px; margin: 0 0 6px;\">WEEK 6-9</p>\n<h3 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 18px; font-weight: bold; margin: 0 0 10px; line-height: 1.3;\">Production</h3>\n<p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.55; margin: 0;\">Manufacturing runs in our FDA-registered facility with full QA.</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center; position: relative;\">\n<div style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 72px; height: 72px; background: white; border: 3px solid #6BA644; border-radius: 50%; margin: 0 0 18px; position: relative; z-index: 2;\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#012638\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"width: 32px; height: 32px;\"><path d=\"M8.25 18.75a1.5 1.5 0 1 1-3 0 1.5 1.5 0 0 1 3 0ZM18.75 18.75a1.5 1.5 0 1 1-3 0 1.5 1.5 0 0 1 3 0Z\">&nbsp;</path><path d=\"m8.25 18.75 4-15a3 3 0 0 1 2.92-2.25h.83a3 3 0 0 1 2.92 2.25l4 15M3 5.25h2.16c.93 0 1.74.59 2.04 1.46l3.6 10.79M3 8.25h5M3 11.25h5M21 18.75v-3a3 3 0 0 0-3-3h-1.5a3 3 0 0 0-3 3\"></path></svg></div>\n<div style=\"background: #6BA644; color: white; font-size: 11px; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: 1.5px; display: inline-block; padding: 4px 12px; border-radius: 100px; margin: 0 0 12px;\">STEP 05</div>\n<p style=\"color: #6ba644; font-size: 11px; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: 1.5px; margin: 0 0 6px;\">WEEK 10-12</p>\n<h3 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 18px; font-weight: bold; margin: 0 0 10px; line-height: 1.3;\">Launch</h3>\n<p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.55; margin: 0;\">Product ships to your warehouse or fulfillment partner.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>"
     },
