      "html": "<div style=\"background: white; padding: 40px 20px 0; text-align: center;\">\n<h2 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 26px; font-weight: bold; margin: 0;\">Grab the Private Label Client Onboarding Guide<br><br></h2>\n</div>"
