    {
     "body": {
      "html": "<div style=\"background: #e6e5e3; padding: 90px 20px;\">\n  <div style=\"max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center;\">\n    <p style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 2px; margin: 0 0 14px;\">50+ YEARS OF SUPPLEMENT MANUFACTURING</p>\n    <h2 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 34px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.2; margin: 0 0 24px;\">Developed by us. Made for you.</h2>\n    <p style=\"color: #333; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0 0 18px;\">With over 50 years in the health supplement industry, we are one of the most trusted dietary supplement manufacturers. Every private label supplement we produce is doctor-formulated using thoroughly researched ingredients, then scientifically reviewed for efficacy and quality before it ever enters production in our U.S. facilities.</p>\n    <p style=\"color: #333; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0 0 18px;\">FoodScience is an FDA-registered food facility, GMP certified to SQF food safety standards, and certified to NSF GMP 455-2.</p>\n    <p style=\"color: #333; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0 0 40px;\">When you partner with us, our expert team is with you every step of the way. Help your customers find what they want from a source they trust. You.</p>\n    <div style=\"display: flex; gap: 50px; justify-content: center; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n      <img src=\"https://4087538.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/4087538/private-label/DV_PL_Logo_SQF.png\" alt=\"SQF Certified\" style=\"height: 80px; width: auto;\"/>\n      <img src=\"https://4087538.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/4087538/private-label/NSF.png\" alt=\"NSF GMP Certified\" style=\"height: 80px; width: auto;\"/>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>"
     },
     "child_css": {},
     "css": {},
     "id": 216207762522,
     "order": 5,
     "styles": {},
     "type": "rich_text"
    },
    {
     "body": {
      "html": "<div style=\"background: #f7f7f6; padding: 80px 20px;\">\n  <div style=\"max-width: 820px; margin: 0 auto;\">\n    <h2 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 32px; font-weight: 700; text-align: center; margin: 0 0 16px;\">Frequently asked questions</h2>\n    <p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 18px; text-align: center; margin: 0 0 44px;\">None</p>\n    <details style=\"background: white; border-radius: 6px; padding: 0; margin: 0 0 14px; border: 1px solid #e6e5e3; box-shadow: 0 1px 4px rgba(1,38,56,.04);\">\n      <summary style=\"cursor: pointer; padding: 22px 28px; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: #012638; list-style: none; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;\">\n        <span>What's in the Client Onboarding Guide?</span>\n        <span style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; flex-shrink: 0; margin-left: 16px;\">+</span>\n      </summary>\n      <div style=\"padding: 0 28px 24px; color: #444; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.65;\">A week-by-week walkthrough of what to expect during your first 90 days as a private label client. Milestones, decisions you'll need to make, what we need from you when, and how to avoid common delays. Most useful AFTER you've signed an engagement letter.</div>\n    </details><details style=\"background: white; border-radius: 6px; padding: 0; margin: 0 0 14px; border: 1px solid #e6e5e3; box-shadow: 0 1px 4px rgba(1,38,56,.04);\">\n      <summary style=\"cursor: pointer; padding: 22px 28px; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: #012638; list-style: none; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;\">\n        <span>Should I read this before or after I sign?</span>\n        <span style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; flex-shrink: 0; margin-left: 16px;\">+</span>\n      </summary>\n      <div style=\"padding: 0 28px 24px; color: #444; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.65;\">After. The Definitive Guide is for evaluation. The Onboarding Guide is for execution. Reading the Onboarding Guide before you've signed isn't bad but it goes into operational detail that won't be relevant until you're actually ready to launch.</div>\n    </details><details style=\"background: white; border-radius: 6px; padding: 0; margin: 0 0 14px; border: 1px solid #e6e5e3; box-shadow: 0 1px 4px rgba(1,38,56,.04);\">\n      <summary style=\"cursor: pointer; padding: 22px 28px; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: #012638; list-style: none; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;\">\n        <span>What's the most common reason onboarding takes longer than 90 days?</span>\n        <span style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; flex-shrink: 0; margin-left: 16px;\">+</span>\n      </summary>\n      <div style=\"padding: 0 28px 24px; color: #444; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.65;\">Late decisions on label design and SKU selection. Production has fixed lead times. Design rounds depend on decision-maker availability on your end. The fastest launches happen when one person owns brand decisions and can respond quickly to design revisions.</div>\n    </details><details style=\"background: white; border-radius: 6px; padding: 0; margin: 0 0 14px; border: 1px solid #e6e5e3; box-shadow: 0 1px 4px rgba(1,38,56,.04);\">\n      <summary style=\"cursor: pointer; padding: 22px 28px; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: #012638; list-style: none; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;\">\n        <span>Do I need to be available daily during onboarding?</span>\n        <span style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; flex-shrink: 0; margin-left: 16px;\">+</span>\n      </summary>\n      <div style=\"padding: 0 28px 24px; color: #444; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.65;\">No. You need to be available for kickoff, two-three design review rounds (each takes a few days from your end), final label approval, and production go-live confirmation. Total active time on your end is usually under 20 hours across the 90 days.</div>\n    </details><details style=\"background: white; border-radius: 6px; padding: 0; margin: 0 0 14px; border: 1px solid #e6e5e3; box-shadow: 0 1px 4px rgba(1,38,56,.04);\">\n      <summary style=\"cursor: pointer; padding: 22px 28px; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: #012638; list-style: none; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;\">\n        <span>What happens after my first inventory ships?</span>\n        <span style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; flex-shrink: 0; margin-left: 16px;\">+</span>\n      </summary>\n      <div style=\"padding: 0 28px 24px; color: #444; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.65;\">We move into ongoing partnership mode. Reorder cycles, future SKU expansion, custom formulation projects, packaging updates. Your account manager remains your primary contact. There's no contract you're locked into; ongoing work is at-will based on what you need.</div>\n    </details>\n  </div>\n</div>"
     },
